OL,3,GNEWSAWet weather warning for drivers
OL,4,Afrom fire crews
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are warning drivers to
OL,7,Ftake care on the road as the weather
OL,8,Fbecomes wetter after a driver hit a
OL,9,Ftree in Leicester.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FSpencefield Lane at about 02:30 BST on
OL,13,FSaturday after a vehicle left the road
OL,14,Fand hit a tree, leading to the driver
OL,15,Fbeing taken to hospital with
OL,16,Fnon-life-threatening injuries.
OL,18,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,19,Fsaid the car's roof was removed "to
OL,20,Fallow a safe extrication of the
OL,21,Fdriver".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
