OL,3,GNEWSAWet weather warning for drivers
OL,4,Afrom fire crews
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe service advised drivers to avoid
OL,7,Fgoing through flooded roads, take care
OL,8,Fif going through standing water, and
OL,9,Fadapt to the conditions when travelling
OL,10,Fin inclement weather.
